For the most current recommended Framework patches, use [2300940/KB163512] - How to Identify what is the Framework Bundle Level Applied in 12.1 and 12.2 Installations.<br><br> For the most current EBS recommended patches, use Patch Wizard or the Updates & Patches Tab in My Oracle Support.<br> 
