The latest recommended Framework Codelevel ['||mask_text(g_fwk_level, nvl( upper(''), 'NO_MASK') )||'] patches for this '||mask_text(g_apps_version, nvl( upper(''), 'NO_MASK') )||' instance '||mask_text(g_instance, nvl( upper(''), 'NO_MASK') )||' have been applied.<br><br>';
