      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => '<p>Organization Document Types Setup.</p>
<p>Use the Document Types window to define access, security, and control specifications for all Purchasing documents. You cannot enter new document types; you can enter new document subtypes only for RFQs and quotations.</p>
<p>To define document types please see&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://docs.oracle.com/cd/E18727_01/doc.121/e13410/T446883T443950.htm#4021156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Oracle&amp;reg; Purchasing User''s Guide Release 12.1 Part No. E13410-05 - page 1-68</a></p>',
