',
      p_title                  => 'Consolidated Active Change Request Data',
      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => '<p>Consolidated Collection of Data for Active Change Requests and related data from Purchase Order (PO) or Release header, PO Line Locations (shipments), Action History, Requisition header, and PO Change Requests.</p>
This is not intended to show all the change request rows - only distinct rows, based on the data queried.  It will not show all the detailed rows for each change request.  It shows some of the details from PO_CHANGE_REQUESTS table for the active change requests, as well as important details from related tables including the following:
<ul>
<li>PO or Release Header    WF_ITEM_TYPE, WF_ITEM_KEY, AUTHORIZATION_STATUS, APPROVED_FLAG, CHANGE_REQUESTED_BY</li>
<li>PO Line Locations    APPROVED_FLAG</li>
<li>PO Action History    with ACTION_CODE null</li>
<li>Requisition Header    WF_ITEM_TYPE, WF_ITEM_KEY, AUTHORIZATION_STATUS, CHANGE_PENDING_FLAG</li>
</ul>',
      p_solution               => '<p>This collection of data is helpful for checking current data values before and after applying the datafix from [453551/KB625956] or [1487301/KB784117] or other similar datafix scripts.  The change should not remain ''active'' after completing through the application or resetting the change with a datafix. </p>
<p>More details are available in separate signatures in the Document Details section and Change Requests section of this analyzer output, but this signature provides a consolidated view of some of the values for active change requests against the document and it''s related documents - PO / Release / Requisition.</p>',
      p_success_msg            => 'No Active change request data found (where PO_CHANGE_REQUESTS.CHANGE_ACTIVE_FLAG = Y) for this document and it''s related documents - PO / Release / Requisition.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('FAILURE','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('W','W'),
      p_print_sql_output       => nvl('RS','RS'),
      p_limit_rows             => nvl('Y','Y'),
      p_extra_info             => l_info,
      p_child_sigs             => VARCHAR_TBL(),
      p_include_in_dx_summary  => nvl('Y','N'),
      p_version                => '6'
      );
   l_info.delete;
debug('end add_signature: EBS_MFG_PO_IPDIAGCA_ACTIVE_CHANGE_REQUEST_DATA');



